{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_33917","headline":"秋晚访李处士所居 · 皮日休","name":"秋晚访李处士所居","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"门前襄水碧潺潺，静钓归来不掩关。\n书阁鼠穿厨簏破，竹园霜後桔橰闲。\n儿童不许惊幽鸟，药草须教上假山。\n莫爲爱诗偏念我，访君多得醉中还。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"皮日休","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_33917.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_33917","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}